One caveat on faithfulness: where C reads uninitialized stack ([38;5;10mc2Proxy[0m/[38;5;10mc2Simplex[0m in [38;5;10mc2GJK[0m), I zero-initialize. Reproducing arbitrary stack garbage isn't possible, and with [38;5;10mpanic = "abort"[0m a bounds-check panic would be worse than garbage, so out-of-contract index paths use raw pointer arithmetic to mirror C's behavior instead of panicking. Every in-contract path is unaffected.[0m[0m
